			"Message": "feat(Project): Coordinate file dialog integration and Tauri event bridge across Land submodules\n\nAdvance the Element submodule with coordinated changes across four Land components:\n- Wind: Add ShowOpenDialog and ShowSaveDialog to FilesService with native file dialog integration via IPC to Mountain backend\n- Sky: Implement SkyBridge.ts - a new Tauri event bridge for sky:// channel communication, routing events to VS Code workbench APIs across 8 categories (Editor, Output, StatusBar, Progress, Terminal, Webview, Native, UI)\n- Grove: Fix string ownership in LanguageNamespace provider registration to eliminate lifetime issues\n- Mountain: Simplify entry point comments in Library.rs for clarity\n\nThis coordinated update completes the native file dialog integration in Wind's service layer while establishing the frontend IPC infrastructure in Sky for Mountain to drive UI updates via Tauri events.",
			"SHA": "29c11a0356d1174b6a0b7d3bbf0cd63978f06c9d"
