				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				87,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Update Element submodule with webview IPC and gitmodules fixes\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to include:\n\n**Cocoon**: Implement actual gRPC notifications in WindowService's IPC proxy to complete the webview lifecycle integration with Mountain backend. SendNotification now posts messages via webview.postMessage, SendRequest returns undefined as fire-and-forget, and dispose callback notifies Mountain to destroy the webview panel via webview.dispose.\n\n**Maintain**: Fix .gitmodules formatting by removing incorrect indentation from the Documentation/Rust submodule entry and add ignore=all directive to prevent local submodule modifications from cluttering git status.\n\nThis coordinated update completes the webview lifecycle IPC while keeping the Maintain workspace clean.",
			"SHA": "a8f68ba46711031c3cb6c78cacf60f8ec7853f88"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T04:10:05Z",
			"File": [
				"⡟⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				87,
				12
			],
			"Message": "style(Maintain): Convert Maintain shell scripts from bash to POSIX sh\n\nUpdate all Maintain build and development scripts to use POSIX-compliant shell syntax instead of bash-specific features.\n\nChanges include:\n- Shebang: #!/usr/bin/env bash → #!/usr/bin/env sh\n- Replace bash arrays with backslash continuation\n- Replace [[ ]] tests with [ ] (POSIX test)\n- Replace ${BASH_SOURCE[0]} with $0 and dirname --\n- Remove local keyword, use positional params instead\n- Remove ANSI color codes from Profile.sh output\n\nAffected scripts: Debug.sh, Debug/All.sh, Debug/Build.sh, Debug/Run.sh, Dev-Mountain.sh, Format.sh, Profile.sh, Release.sh, Release/All.sh, Release/Build.sh, Save.sh\n\nThis improves portability across Unix-like systems that may not have bash available.",
			"SHA": "e75e85f03f905b4e2ca733b3336358b6292e5a5b"
		}
	],
